Package: regionbarcoder
Title: Audit, Deploy, and Export Regional DNA Reference Databases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guohuan", "Su", email = "suguohuan@ihb.ac.cn",role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Zi Xun", "Kua",  role = "aut")
Author: Guohuan Su [aut, cre], Zi Xun Kua [aut]
Maintainer: Guohuan Su <suguohuan@ihb.ac.cn>
Description: Provides tools to query, audit, export, assign amplicon sequence
    variants, and report regional DNA reference databases for ecological
    metabarcoding. The package supports local full YZFishDB SQLite releases and
    enables Yangtze River Basin fish eDNA ASV assignment against YZFishDB.
